One game I really enjoy is Count Masters: Stickman Clash. In the game, you start with just one stickman and run through gates that add more to your group, like "+20" or "x3". As you go, you have to avoid obstacles and fight other stickmen groups. The best part is watching your army grow and then battling the enemies, especially the boss at the end of each level. It's exciting and satisfying when you win with a huge group. I like it because it’s simple, fun, and it keeps getting more challenging as you go. It’s a great game to play when you want to relax and have some fun.
